{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">AZALPEN-LIBURUXKA</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">DELMASEN</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">laguntza-taulentzat</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">LEHEN SAILA</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">1. TAULA</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Eskola. — Lizeoa. — Ikasgela.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Deskribapen orokorra.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Taula honetan lizeoko <b>ikasgela</b> bat ageri da. Ikasgela honetan zortzi <b>mahai</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"mahai\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> eta zortzi <b>banku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"banku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button> daude. Banku bakoitzean hiru ikasle eserita daude. <b>Irakaslea</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"Irakaslea\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> <b>aulki</b> batean <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> eserita dago bere <b>katedraren</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedraren\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> atzean.","t01-02-1":"2. — Katedraren ezkerrean beirazko <b>armairu</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fisikarako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> dago. Eskuinean, <b>arbela</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"arbela\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button>, bere <b>trapuarekin</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"trapuarekin\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> eta <b>klarionarekin</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"klarionarekin\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Katedraren gainean <b>horma-irudiak</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"horma-irudiak\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"horma-irudiak\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"horma-irudiak\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> eta <b>mapa</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button> zintzilik daude.","t01-03-1":"3. — Ikasle guztiak ez daude beren <b>lekuetan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"lekuetan\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Joanes <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> arbelaren ondoan zutik dago; trapua eskuan darama eta <b>geometria-irudiak</b> ezabatzen ari da.","t01-03-2":"Petri katedraren ondoan zutik dago; <b>idazlanak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"idazlanak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> biltzen ari da irakasleari eramateko.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>Irakasle</b> hau <b>hizkuntza modernoetakoa</b> da. Ikasleei atzerriko hizkuntzetan hitz egiten, irakurtzen eta idazten erakusten die <b>(alemana, ingelesa, gaztelania, italiera, errusiera</b> edo <b>frantsesa)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Ikasgela oso handia eta oso argitsua da. Barrenean <b>leiho</b> zabal bat dago, bi <b>gainleihorekin</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"gainleihorekin\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button>, eta <b>beirazko ate</b> bat, gela aireztatzeko eta argitzeko.","t01-05-2":"Ikasgela honetan ez da hotzik egiten. Erdian, gela berotzeko, <b>berogailu</b> oso on bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> dago, bere <b>ke-hodiarekin</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"ke-hodiarekin\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Trenkadan <b>esekitokiak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"esekitokiak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> iltzatuta daude; haietan ikasleen kapelak eta berokiak zintzilikatzen dira.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Jolastokia.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>Erlojuak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"Erlojuak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> bederatziak eta bost markatzen ditu.","t01-06-2":"<b>Jolasaldia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"Jolasaldia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> amaitu berri da, eta ikasgaia berriro hasten ari da. Jolasaldia <b>jolastokian</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"jolastokian\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button> igarotzen da. Zenbait ikasle jolasean ikusten ditugu. <b>Zaintzaileak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Zaintzaileak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> begiratzen die.","t01-07-1":"7. — Jolastokian beste jende bat ere ikusten dugu: <b>ikuskatzailea</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"ikuskatzailea\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, <b>zuzendaria</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"zuzendaria\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> eta <b>ikasketaburua</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"ikasketaburua\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Ikuskatzaileak eskolak aztertzen ditu, zuzendariak ikastetxea gobernatzen du, ikasketaburuak ikasleen lanari begiratzen dio.","t01-07-3":"Laugarrena <b>atezaina</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"atezaina\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button> da. Erregistroa besapean darama, faltak markatzeko.","t01-08-1":"8. — Jolastokiaren barrenean <b>gimnasia-tresnak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnasia-tresnak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> eta <b>eskulanaren</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"eskulanaren\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> lantegia daude.","t01-08-2":"Taularen eskuinean ozta-ozta ikusten dira <b>musikako</b> eta <b>marrazketako</b> <b>ikasgelak</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Deskribapen zehatza.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Ikasle onak.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Katedraren eskuinean, lehen bankuko ikasleak <b>Henrike</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"eu-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Estepan</b> eta <b>Karlos</b> dira.","t01-09-2":"Henrike oso adi eta oso saiatua da; irakasleari entzuten dio. Mahai gainean <b>koaderno</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>liburu</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>hiztegi</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> eta <b>arkatz-ontzi</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button> ditu. Bere liburuak <b>orrialde</b> asko ditu; kapitulu bakoitzean <b>paragrafo</b> batzuk daude, eta <b>lerro</b> bakoitzean <b>hitz</b> asko.","t01-09-4":"Estepan bere aldamenekoa <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> langilea da. Hurrengorako emandako ikasgaia koadernoan idazten ari da. <b>Idazkera</b> bikaina du. Bere liburua itxita dago. <b>Azala</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"Azala\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button> baino ez zaio ikusten. Haren ondoan bere <b>konpasa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"konpasa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button> datza.","t01-09-5":"Karlosek <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> liburua eskuan dauka; irekitzen ari da, ikasgaia berriro errepasatzeko. Ikasle orori bezala, aurrean <b>tintontzi</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> du. Esanekoa da.","t01-10-1":"10. — Hurrengo mahaian <b>Ludobiko, Anton</b> eta <b>Paulo</b> daude eserita. Ludobikok bere <b>ikasgaia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"ikasgaia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> errezitatzen du eta irakaslearen <b>galderei</b> erantzuten die. Anton <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> oso adigabea da; batzuetan irakasleak zigortu ere egiten du. Paulo <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> lagun ona da, atsegina eta prestua. Oso adi dago.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Ikasle txarrak.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Henrikeren atzean <b>Jurgi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Jurgi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button> dago eserita. Ez da mutil gaiztoa, baina <b>berritsua</b> da, adigabea eta ezin geldi egon daitekeena. Bere <b>arinkeriak</b> eta <b>desobedientziak</b> <b>nahastea</b> sartzen dute ikasgaian, eta sarritan <b>ohartarazpen</b> zorrotza merezi du. Bere <b>zirriborroa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"zirriborroa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> zikina dago; <b>tinta-orbanak</b> egiten ditu bere <b>lumaz</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"lumaz\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, eta horregatik etengabe darabil bere <b>goma</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"goma\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; bere <b>motxila</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"motxila\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> urratuta dago, hain da zabarra. Zertarako dakar bere <b>idazluma</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"idazluma\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> hizkuntza modernoen ikasgelara?","t01-11-2":"Bere aldamenekoak, Edmundek <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button>, ez du maite. Egia da pixka bat alferra dela, baina isila eta lasaia da. Ez da berritsua; entzun beharrean, <b>ipuinak</b> irakurtzea nahiago du bere <b>irakurgai-liburuan</b>.","t01-11-3":"Banku honetako hirugarren ikaslea <b>Ludwig</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludwig\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button> da. Saiatua da. <b>Paper-orri</b> zuri baten gainean idazten du. Aurrean <b>xurgapapera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"xurgapapera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button> jarri du.","t01-12-1":"12. — Irakaslearen ezkerrean, bigarren bankuko ikasleak oso txikiak dira. Lehena, <b>Emil</b> txikia, ez da oraindik ondo idazten trebea; bere <b>arbeltxoa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"arbeltxoa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, bere <b>arbel-arkatza</b> eta bere <b>belakia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"belakia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button> dakartza.","t01-12-2":"Haren ondoan <b>Augusto</b> eta <b>Bernardo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button> daude. Azken honek ondo lan egiten du, baina <b>itxura</b> oso zabarra du.","t01-13-1":"13. — Haien atzean hiru <b>alfer</b> daude eserita. <b>Albertok</b> ez ditu ikasgaiak ikasten. <b>Jakobe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jakobe\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> lo dago entzun beharrean. Bere <b>alferkeriak</b> <b>errietak</b> eta <b>zigorrak</b> ere ekartzen dizkio. Azkenik, <b>Kristian</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristian\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> arinegia da. Gaizki <b>portatzen</b> da eta ez da zuzentzen saiatzen.","t01-14-1":"14. — Haien aldamenekoak, aitzitik, ondo portatzen dira. <b>Ernestok</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestok\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> ordena eta zehaztasuna maite ditu; beti darabiltza bere <b>erregela</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"erregela\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> eta bere <b>arkatza</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"arkatza\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. <b>Kanpo-ikaslea</b> da.","t01-14-2":"<b>Frantzisko</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Frantzisko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> <b>barne-ikaslea</b> da; uniformea darama, ikastetxean jaten eta lo egiten du. <b>Lagun</b> ona da.","t01-14-3":"Mauriziok bere <b>arkatza</b> zorrozten du bere <b>kanibetaz</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kanibetaz\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; oso zuhurra da.","t01-14-4":"Bere liburu guztiak dakartza, bere <b>gramatika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, bere <b>ohar-koadernoa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"ohar-koadernoa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> eta bere <b>ohar-bloka</b> ere <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Bere <b>kartera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"kartera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> lurrean datza, haren atzean.","t01-14-5":"Ikasgelaren barreneko bi mahaiak <b>ikasle onek</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"ikasle onek\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button> betetzen dituzte.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Marrazketa eta musika.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — <b>Marrazketa-gelan</b> horman <b>eredu</b> ederrak daude zintzilik, eta sabaitik <b>lanpara</b> bat <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> dilindan dago, bere <b>pantailarekin</b>. <b>Irakaslea</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"Irakaslea\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> oso pazientziatsua da; ikasleen <b>marrazkiak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"marrazkiak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> zuzentzen ditu eta <b>bustoa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"bustoa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> naturaletik marrazten erakusten die.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>Musika-gela</b> oso atsegina dirudi. Han <b>notak</b> irakurtzen, <b>eskala-mailak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"eskala-mailak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> kantatzen — <b>pentagraman</b> idatziak (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.) — , <b>giltzak</b> ezagutzen eta <b>doinu</b> zoragarriak kantatzen ikasten da. Notak <b>atrilaren</b> gainean <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> jartzen dira. Ikasleetako batek <b>pianoa jotzen du</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianoa jotzen du\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button>, eta <b>musika-irakasleak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"musika-irakasleak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>konpasa markatzen du</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"konpasa markatzen du\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Ozta-ozta ikusten da <b>eskulanaren</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"eskulanaren\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> lantegiaren izkina, non haurrek zura lantzen eta burdina limatzen ikas dezaketen. Ez dago eskola guztietan.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Natur zientzien ikasgela.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Matematikako irakasleak <b>geometria,</b> <b>aritmetika, kontuak</b> eta <b>sistema metrikoa</b> irakasten dizkie ikasleei. Taulan geometriako irudi nagusiak ikusten ditugu: <b>zirkulua</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zirkulua\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>karratua</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"karratua\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>triangelua</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangelua\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>marra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"marra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"<b>Eragiketa</b> bat ere ikusten dugu; ez da <b>batuketa</b>, ez <b>kenketa</b>, ez <b>biderketa</b>: <b>zatiketa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"zatiketa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button> da.","t01-19-1":"19. — Sistema metrikoaren taulan hauek ikusten ditugu: <b>metroa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metroa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>balantza</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balantza\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> eta bere <b>pisuak</b>, <b>litroa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"litroa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>dekalitroa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitroa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>dezilitroa</b> eta <b>metro kubikoa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metro kubikoa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Ikasleek <b>natur zientziak</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"horma-irudiak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> ere ikasten dituzte — zoologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botanika <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botanika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — eta <b>historia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"horma-irudiak\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Armairuan <b>fisikarako</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fisikarako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> eta <b>kimikarako</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kimikarako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> tresnak daude.","t01-19-4":"Armairuaren gainean hauek daude: <b>esfera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"esfera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>konoa</b> eta <b>globoa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"globoa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Taulen gainean <b>mapa</b> bat dago zintzilik, munduaren bost zatiak erakusten dituena: <b>Europa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Asia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Afrika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Amerika</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> eta <b>Ozeania</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Ozeania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, eta bi ozeano handiak — <b>Barea</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Barea\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> eta <b>Atlantikoa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantikoa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) <i>Izenentzat</i> ere latinezko forman ematea gomendatzen dugu. Horrela bakarrik saihets daitezke kontaezinezko aldaerak. Eta nola hautatu <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Joanes</i> eta gainerakoen artean? Ez dugu izenen hiztegi berezirik egingo. Har dezagun latinezko nominatiboa eta esan dezagun: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gramatika osoa)."}}
